## 2. src/services/supabaseClosetsService.ts (live)

- Line 5-7: `closets: Pick<Tables<'closets'>, 'id' | 'closet_name' | 'outfit_labels'> | null;`
- getStylistClosets (:18, :27): `.select('closets(id, closet_name, outfit_labels)')`; map adds `outfit_labels: row.closets.outfit_labels`.
